msgid "The node's miner submits its own Commit To Generation transaction for each generation period"
msgstr "Der Miner des Knotens übermittelt für jede Generationsperiode eine eigene Commit To Generation-Transaktion"

#: ../../05_node-guide/05_configuration.md:34
msgid "`dcc.network.peer-stall-threshold`"
msgstr "`dcc.network.peer-stall-threshold`"

#: ../../05_node-guide/05_configuration.md:34
msgid "`900`"
msgstr "`900`"

#: ../../05_node-guide/05_configuration.md:34
msgid "Ticks (about 1 s each) of peer-reconnection stall before the node clears suspensions and redials"
msgstr "Zecken (jeweils ca. 1 s) der Peer-Reconnection stehen, bevor der Knoten Suspensionen und Redials löscht"

#: ../../05_node-guide/05_configuration.md:34
msgid "`dcc.hotstuff.enabled`"
msgstr "`dcc.hotstuff.enabled`"

#: ../../05_node-guide/05_configuration.md:34
msgid "HotStuff fast-finality engine. Leave it off on Mainnet. The public Testnet's own nodes run it enabled and authoritative (see [Features and Activation](10_features-and-activation))"
msgstr "HotStuff Fast-Finality-Motor. Lassen Sie es auf Mainnet aus. Die öffentlichen Testnet-eigenen Knoten führen sie aktiviert und autoritativ aus (siehe [Features und Aktivierung](10_features-and-activation))"

#: ../../05_node-guide/05_configuration.md:63
